8. Expected Outcome

The expected outcome of the project is a ServiceNow solution that can import employee information from an Excel spreadsheet and create corresponding employee records in the Employee Test table.

The solution should also be able to identify existing employee records using Coalesce, update existing records, insert new records, and prevent duplicate records when the same data is imported again.

The project will also provide reports and an analytics dashboard for viewing and analyzing employee information.

9. Conclusion

The brainstorming and ideation phase establishes the project idea, problem statement, proposed solution, objectives, initial data fields, and expected workflow.

The project will demonstrate the use of ServiceNow Import Sets and Transform Maps for structured employee data migration from an external spreadsheet.


